ev-am","author":["[[Don Day - BoiseDev Editor]]"],"published":"2026-06-10","created":"2026-07-08","description":"In May, the City of Pocatello’s hearing examiner nixed plans for a $2.6 billion data center proposed in the city. Now, the developer’s attorneys are appealing the decision. As BoiseDev reported, Lex Developments has applied to convert the former Hoku Materials polysilicon plant into an AI data center on 49 acres of land on the west […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},